usionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k10-e2","@type":"Quotation","label":"deeply cherishing his deep trust and expectation","start":2398,"end":2446,"stance":"supports","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:DocumentSnapshot:source-64cf3657-76bd-486e-90cc-c3058a560645"]},{"@id":"urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:OriginGroup:k10%3Aorigin-affb18fd8d27","@type":"OriginGroup","label":"2026-02-27 북한 매체 저격총 수여 행사 보도","originVerified":true,"independence":"unconfirmed","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k10-e1","urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k10-e2"]},{"@id":"urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Claim:k11","@type":"Claim","label":"경향신문에 따르면 국정원이 추정해 온 김주애의 오빠와 동생의 존재는 공식 확인된 적이 없으며, 국정원은 최근 오빠가 있을 가능성을 낮게 판단한 것으로 보인다.","status":"independence-pending","confidence":"medium","aboutActor":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Actor:e4"],"groundedIn":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k11-e1","urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k11-e2"],"hasOrigin":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:OriginGroup:k11%3Aorigin-b051dd5d9192","urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:OriginGroup:k11%3Aorigin-3ad96963dd3a"]},{"@id":"urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k11-e1","@type":"Quotation","label":"그간 국정원은 주애(2013년생 추정) 이외에 2010년생 오빠와 2017년생 동생이 있을 것으로 추정했지만 이들의 존재가 공식 확인된 적은 없다.","start":681,"end":763,"stance":"supports","wasDerivedFrom":["urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:DocumentSnapshot:source-197ed29f-2b00-436c-9e05-5c655ad8435a"]},{"@id":"urn:fusionbrief:run:0fd3a59c-817b-463a-9021-a7416760f6cd:Quotation:k11-e2","@type":"Quotation","label":"국정원은 최근 오빠의 존재 가능성을 낮게 판단한 것으로 보인다.","start":764,"end":799,"stance":"supports","wasD